    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Portfolio Positioning Strategic Support"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S1",
      "override": {
        "spaceBeforePt": 0.0,
        "spaceAfterPt": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Proposal"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S2"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "December 1, 2025"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S2"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Context and Objectives"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S3"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Helix is a leader in the biotech vaccine space, now with two commercialized vaccines (respiratory illness and viral infection) and a series of expected future launching including Flu, respiratory illness+Flu, and gastroenteric virus"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To date, Helix messaging has largely focused around individual vaccines but with this emerging portfolio, Helix has a unique opportunity to position its portfolio globally "
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Success in redefining this portfolio and organizational positioning will ultimately support Helix’s commercial success globally"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To that end, Helix is seeking support to:"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Develop and explore positioning territories and value propositions for the Helix portfolio at the global level"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Align on the most impactful portfolio positioning and translate these into a cohesive portfolio messaging platform with value drivers, proof points, and tailored messaging by stakeholder audience"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Key questions to be answered in the project include"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "TBD"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "page_break",
      "pStyle": "S6"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Proposed Project Approach"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S3"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 1: Rapidly Kickoff and Align on Project Objectives"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Conduct a kickoff meeting with the Helix team"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Align on objectives and project cadence including key stakeholders for input and required working sessions"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Draft approach/plan for working sessions and key workshops and identify preparation needs (e.g., pre-read materials) "
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Transfer relevant prior Helix work that can inform workshop pre-reads "
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 2a: Conduct Preparatory Working Sessions"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Conduct a series of small-group working sessions with key Helix functional teams to discuss positioning hypotheses tied to specific stakeholder needs "
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [],
      "pStyle": "S7"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Goal of working-sessions is to understand ingoing perspectives on key stakeholder needs and the value proposition that the Helix portfolio could bring, and identify key topics for discussion during the broader workshop"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 2b: Develop Workshop Facilitation Materials"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Align on the overall goals and agenda for the workshop"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Leverage existing Helix work to assemble a pre-read and other preparatory materials to support the discussion"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Note, we assume that Helix has sufficient existing materials to support the workshop and that Meridian Strategy can conduct targeted additional analyses to support the workshop (e.g., develop a case study, compiling pricing in key markets, etc.)"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If more extensive ne-new analysis and material generation is required an additional scope is required (see budget)"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 3: Facilitate Positioning and Messaging Workshop"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Share pre-read and preparatory materials ~1 week before the workshop"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Facilitate a day-long workshop (assume in person in Helix office) to "
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Define and prioritize positioning territories and key value propositions"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S7"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Draft foundational messaging materials / ideas that support the value propositions (for further testing)"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S7"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 4: Finalize outputs"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Synthesize the outputs of the workshop into a comprehensive strategic document articulating the aligned upon global portfolio positioning with supporting messages"
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Define messages and hypotheses to test in further market research "
        }
      ],
      "pStyle": "S5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Final output will include a focused set of slides that can be used to support leadership presentations"
        }
